{"articleNo":"59262","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=59262&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"사단법인 경북산학융합본부 원장초빙","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2012.07.19","hit":"3877","attachments":[{"name":"경북 원장 초빙 공고문 120719.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=59262&attachNo=69170"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><br></span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 190%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 190%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.2pt; FONT-SIZE: 20pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">사단법인 경북산학융합본부 원장초빙</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 190%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 190%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><br></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 190%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 190%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;구미·왜관 산업단지의 산학일체형 산학협력을 추진하기</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 190%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"> 위해서 </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 190%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.8pt; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">중앙정부(지경부, 교과부), 지자체(경상북도, 구미시, 칠곡군), 4개 대학(금오공대, 영진전문대, 경운대, 구미대), 유관기관(한국산업단지공단 대경권본부)이 </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 190%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">공동으로 설립한 사단법인 경북산학융합본부의 발전을 위한 비전을 제시할 수 있고, 이를 성공적으로 수행할 수 있는</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 190%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"> 분을 원장으로 모십니다.</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 190%; TEXT-INDENT: -40pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 40pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 190%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><br></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 190%; TEXT-INDENT: -40pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 40pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 190%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">1. 응모자격</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 190%; TEXT-INDENT: -20pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 30pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 190%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">○&nbsp;산학협력 및 고등교육에 대한 합리적 이해와 경험을 갖춘 분</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 190%; TEXT-INDENT: -20pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 30pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 190%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 190%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">○</span> 공정한 인사운영과 합리적 경영으로 조직을 발전시킬 수 있는 분</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 190%; TEXT-INDENT: -20pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 30pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 190%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 190%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">○</span> </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 190%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: -2pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">산업기술에 대한 탁월한 식견을 가지고 산학융합지구를 발전시킬 수 있는 분</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 190%; TEXT-INDENT: -12.6pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 22.6pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 190%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 190%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">○</span> 국가공무원법 제33조(결격사유)에 해당하지 않는 자로서 아래의 해당요건 <br>1가지 이상 충족한 자</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; TEXT-INDENT: -28.7pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 36.2pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">&nbsp; &nbsp;· </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: -1.2pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">대기업, </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">중소기업지원기관.단체</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: -2.9pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">,</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: -1.7pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"> </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: -1.4pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">정부</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: -1.2pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">투</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">자기관, </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: -1.7pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">제1금융기관에서 임원으로 재</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">직한 경력이 있는 자</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; TEXT-INDENT: -28.7pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 36.2pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;· </span></span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">국가 및 지방자치단체에서 4급이상으로 재직한 경력이 있는 자</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; TEXT-INDENT: -28.7pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 36.2pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;· </span></span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">주식회사 대표이사로 7년이상 재직한 경력이 있는 자</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; TEXT-INDENT: -28.7pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 36.2pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;·&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">상기 각 요건과 동등한 자격이 있다고 인정되는자</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; TEXT-INDENT: -28.7pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 36.2pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><br></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 190%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 190%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">2. 심사방법</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 190%; TEXT-INDENT: -20pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 30pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 190%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 190%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">○</span> 서류심사(1차) : 이력 및 법인발전계획 작성문 등</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 190%; TEXT-INDENT: -127.3pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 137.3pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 190%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 190%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">○</span> 면접심사(2차) : 서류심사 합격자를 대상으로 법인발전, 추진 의지 및 계획 실현성 등에 대한 소견 발표 및 면접심사</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 190%; TEXT-INDENT: -40pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 40pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 190%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">3. 제출서류</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 190%; TEXT-INDENT: -20pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 30pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 190%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 190%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">○</span> 이력서 1부(최근 3개월 이내 사진부착)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 190%; TEXT-INDENT: -20pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 30pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 190%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 190%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">○</span> 경력증명서, 졸업증명서, 학위증명서 및 관련자격증(해당자)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 190%; TEXT-INDENT: -20pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 30pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 190%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 190%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">○</span> 주요 업적 및 경력소개서(A4 3매 이내)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 190%; TEXT-INDENT: -20pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 30pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 190%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 190%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">○</span> 운영계획서(전체 A4 5매 이내)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 190%; TEXT-INDENT: -20pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 30pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 190%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;1) 산업기술 및 고등교육에 대한 견해 및 산학협력 추진 방안</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 190%; TEXT-INDENT: -20pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 30pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 190%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;2) 법인발전 계획</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 190%; TEXT-INDENT: -20pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 30pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 190%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><br></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; TEXT-INDENT: -40pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 40pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">4. 접수일정 및 접수처</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; TEXT-INDENT: -40pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 50pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 190%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">○</span> 공고/접수일정 : 2012. 7. 19(목) ∼ 8. 2(목) 18:00, 당일 도착분 한함.</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; TEXT-INDENT: -40pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 50pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 190%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">○</span> 접수방법 : 방문접수 또는 우편접수</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; TEXT-INDENT: -40pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 50pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 190%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">○</span> 접 수 처 : 경북 구미시 대학로 61 금오공과대학교 글로벌관 556호 <br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; (사)경북산학융합본부 임시사무국 원장추천위원회</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; TEXT-INDENT: -40pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 40pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><br></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; TEXT-INDENT: -40pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 40pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">5. 기타</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; TEXT-INDENT: -20pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 30pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 190%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">○</span> 제출한 서류는 일체 반환하지 않으며, 기재된 내용이 사실과 다를 경우 임용을 취소할 수 있으며, 심사결과 적격자 부재시 채용하지 않을 수 있음.</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; TEXT-INDENT: -20pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 30pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: -1pt; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 190%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">○</span> 기타 자세한 사항은 </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">(사)경북산학융합본부 임시사무국 원장추천위원회</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; TEXT-INDENT: -20pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 30pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.4pt; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;전화 : 054-478-6905~6으로 문의하시기 바람</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; TEXT-INDENT: -40pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 40pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><br></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; TEXT-INDENT: -40pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 40pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><br></span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; TEXT-INDENT: -40pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 40pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; LETTER-SPACING: -2pt; FONT-SIZE: 20pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">사단법인 경북산학융합본부 원장추천위원회 위원장</span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
